    "extract": "Schenker AG, doing business as DB Schenker, is a German logistics company that serves local and global firms across various industries. Notably, it manages large and complex supply chains for multinationals such as Apple, Procter & Gamble, Dell, ASML, BMW.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Schenker AG</b>, doing business as <b>DB Schenker</b>, is a German logistics company that serves local and global firms across various industries. Notably, it manages large and complex supply chains for multinationals such as Apple, Procter &amp; Gamble, Dell, ASML, BMW.</p>"
